{"articleNo":"312721","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=312721&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [중소기업산학협력센터]2021년도 사업연계형 기술개발지원 사업 모집공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.06.21","hit":"16268","attachments":[{"name":"사업연계형기술개발지원사업.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=312721&attachNo=101328"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">중소벤처기업부에서 지원하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">년도 사업연계형 기술개발지원사업</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">에 참여하고자 하는 교수 및 주관기관을 대상으로 다음과 같이 모집합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">사업명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: 2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">년도 사업연계형 기술개발지원사업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">2. 사업목적 : 단편적 R&amp;D지원 중심에서 중장기적 지원체계로 전환을 통해 중소기업의 안정적인 사업화 성과창출 및 R&amp;D 생태계 조성</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">지원기관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">중소벤처기업부</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">4. 지원규모(신규) : '21년도 <strong><strong>15개 과제</strong></strong> 이내</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><!--StartFragment--></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">5.&nbsp;지원분야 : 사업별 지원분야 및 품목(자유응모&nbsp;· 품목지정 · 지정공모)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">6. 지원대상 : 중소기업법 제2조에 따른 중소기업 중 연계희망 사업별 지원자격을 충족하는 중소기업</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">7.&nbsp;지원내용 : 지원기간과 규모는 단계별 내역 사업 연계 결과에 따름</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; *(예시) 디딤돌(1단계)+전략형(2단계) -&gt; 최대 3년간 4.5억원 이내 지원 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수출지향형(1단계)+공동투자형(2단계) -&gt; 최대 7년 간 32억원 이내 지원 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">8. 접수기간 :<strong><strong> 2021.07.05(월) ∼ 2021.07.19(월) 18:00까지</strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">9. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">중소기업산학협력센터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-asc